WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.890
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:06.360
<i>A string of events sent me to another world,</i>

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.320
<i>but after eating some Fruit of Evolution,</i>

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.030
<i>my fat, ugly body transformed 
into an OP physique!</i>

00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:13.800
<i>The gorilla, Saria, and I went 
to the royal capital, Telbert,</i>

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.840
<i>and joined the adventurer's guild there,</i>

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:19.950
<i>but our test proctor was a lone warrior!</i>

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.340
I'm Artoria Gremm...

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.850
Artoria, the Calamity.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.310
Okay, let's start your tests.

00:00:33.310 --> 00:00:34.970
Okay!

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.770
First up is gathering.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.160
Once each of you has harvested ten

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.970
of the Medicinal Herbs growing around 
that area, you'll clear the test.

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.480
Huh? That's all?

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:45.980
That's all.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:48.350
That's super easy, though!

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:49.980
Saria, let's go!

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.130
Hey! I wasn't done explaining!

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:54.430
We'll be back!

00:00:54.430 --> 00:00:57.030
Hey, wait up, Seiichi!

00:00:58.180 --> 00:00:59.200
Sheesh.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.990
Why am I smiling?

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:08.250
<i>I can't let anyone be 
victimized by this anymore.</i>

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.170
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:18.170
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:44.140
<b>Black Dragon God's Dungeon</b>

00:02:39.890 --> 00:02:43.360
All right, now show me the 
herbs you've gathered.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.010
Here!

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:47.140
Good.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:52.110
You plucked them up from 
the root, just like I said.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:54.220
Yeah, exactly as you said!

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:56.030
Okay, next is Seiichi.

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:57.150
Here!

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.030
What are these?

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.740
A rare item, "Mana Mushroom."

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:09.790
Your test was to gather ten medicinal herbs!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:12.370
Well... I just couldn't find any of those.

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.240
There are some right there at your feet!

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:16.630
God damn!

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.350
I gathered them!

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.470
What about the remaining five?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:23.330
Huh?

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:24.640
You're missing some.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.140
I-I'll go search again!

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.140
H-Hey!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.150
There are none!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.150
Mana Mushroom.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:42.150
Antidote Weed.

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.520
Why is there nothing but rare items

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:47.660
and none of the regular herbs?!

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.440
Do you really think this will work?

00:03:50.440 --> 00:03:51.110
There, all done!

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.670
It's coming along well.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.530
We've finally gone and done it now!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:59.170
We should catch at least one 
human after setting up that many!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:04.180
But was it really okay to ignore Leia-sama's 
orders and come to the human realm?

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:05.380
Dumbass!

00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:08.230
If this operation succeeds, 
there won't be any punishment!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:11.180
Rising up and getting the hero's 
treatment isn't just a dream!

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:16.690
You all have families, too, don't you?

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.320
<i>What are they talking about?</i>

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.220
<i>Whatever.</i>

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:22.190
<i>I'll just ask if they've seen 
any Medicinal Herbs nearby.</i>

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.940
Let's do this!

00:04:23.940 --> 00:04:24.850
Excuse me...

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:26.070
Who's there?!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.630
Wh-Why is a human here?!

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.700
Did he already hear our plan?!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.480
Oh, no!

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:36.380
I don't want to face Leia's punishment!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:39.210
Uh, I'm looking for Herbs...

00:04:39.210 --> 00:04:41.780
If you've found us out, 
then we have no choice!

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:42.970
Let's go!

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:45.970
Terry Hemd!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:48.970
Bosco Dan!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:53.760
The leader, Bel Giselle! And together...

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:58.730
We are the personal squad of Leia-sama, 
captain of the demon army's third division!

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.690
Victim!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.090
<i>Oh, they're just perverts.</i>

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.200
You're not getting away!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.380
Now that you've seen us here,

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:14.200
we can't let you leave alive!

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.450
Come forth, Troll!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.720
Get him!

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.220
We did it!

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:34.730
That was a clean hit to the face!

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:38.750
Huh?

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.230
Oh, it worked.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.840
My Absorb skill.

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:51.000
So it can even transfer my 
opponent's strength into my own?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.510
That's handy.

00:05:53.150 --> 00:05:55.120
He definitely just...

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:56.500
...hit him, right?

00:06:04.680 --> 00:06:06.010
So, hey.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.080
About the Herbs...

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:13.330
W-Well, our operation here 
was already finished anyway.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:16.270
W-W-W-W-We'll let you go this time!

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.680
Retreat!

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:23.020
Hey, wait! The Herbs!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.140
I didn't get to ask them.

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:32.030
So... why did you gather 
nothing but rare items?!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:35.040
I searched the best I could.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:38.040
Sheesh...

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.360
Here, you can have these.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.540
A-Are you sure?

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:46.970
Try harder next time.

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:48.550
Good for you, Seiichi!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.170
Boss!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.550
Sh-Shut up! Let's hurry on to the next one.

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.310
Now...

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:10.940
Why did the three of you disobey 
orders to go to the human realm?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:14.950
We went to set up teleportation 
spells all over the place.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:16.830
To what end?

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.960
To shave the human realm's 
forces down a little more!

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:23.960
And where exactly do you 
have them teleporting to?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.960
You'll be surprised when you hear it!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.220
To the Black Dragon God's Dungeon!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:31.280
What?! The Black Dragon God?!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:34.460
Well, I feel bad for the 
humans they teleport, then.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.510
Yeah!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.510
However...

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.200
It's still a fact that you disobeyed orders,

00:07:40.200 --> 00:07:41.730
so you'll be punished.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.980
I think we'll start light, say about 500 lashes.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.980
No!

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.230
Forgive us!

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.990
Get back here!

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:02.500
Oh, if it isn't Seiichi.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.480
Oh! Claude-san!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.090
We're here today to register 
for the guild's final test.

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.760
Artoria's your test proctor?

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.540
Yeah, what about it?

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:14.450
I see.

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.610
She's a really nice person, is all.

00:08:16.610 --> 00:08:19.770
Please, would you be kind to 
her even after the test's over?

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.870
That goes without saying!

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.770
Artoria-san is precious to us!

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:26.770
Thanks.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:29.700
Huh? You guys know each other?

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:32.780
You've met some good people, huh, Artoria?

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:34.780
Huh?

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:37.700
It's the final test, right?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.280
You come back safe, now.

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:40.120
Yep.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.350
Right!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.790
All right, we're heading out.

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.650
Okay, time for the second test.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:49.800
Right!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.780
The second test is hunting.

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:54.830
Defeat ten slimes, and you've cleared it.

00:08:55.410 --> 00:08:59.180
This is your final test, so show some spirit!

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:00.050
Right!

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.810
Saria, where's your weapon?

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.310
Here!

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:13.180
That just looks like ordinary punching to me.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:16.110
No, those punches are Saria's weapon.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.870
<i>Well, I'll just have to watch over them.</i>

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.600
There's a few right away!

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:26.210
Seiichi! Here they come!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.010
Right!

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:33.500
Huh?

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.130
The slime disappeared?

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.410
Just what is going on here?

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:40.140
Don't tell me!

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:48.150
Seiichi, Saria, the test is on hold.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:49.110
Huh!

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:50.520
Why?

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:53.190
There are teleportation spells 
set up all over the place.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:55.210
Teleportation spells?

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.510
Uh, what's something like that doing here?

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:58.930
How would I know?

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.150
Anyway, we're heading back 
to the guild for now.

00:10:03.820 --> 00:10:04.580
Wha—

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:07.040
Artoria-san!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:16.380
This smell is the smell of loathsome humans.

00:10:19.400 --> 00:10:21.430
Where are we now?

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.560
Do you not know either, Artoria-san?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.300
Yeah, I don't have the slightest clue.

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.060
Regardless, we need to find an exit.

00:10:30.530 --> 00:10:33.820
Hey, Seiichi, Saria, why did 
the two of you follow me?

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:34.920
Huh?

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:36.720
I told you before, didn't I?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.460
An adventurer needs the 
ability to sense danger.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:42.570
If you hadn't touched me at that moment,

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.330
you two might have made it back safely.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.720
Uh...

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:49.460
If you give me a stupid answer, you'll regret it!

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.330
My body just moved before I realized it.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:53.840
Huh?

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.490
Mine, too!

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:58.340
I thought, "I have to help Artoria-san!"

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.970
I do think it was a rash action.

00:11:00.970 --> 00:11:05.350
But more than that, Saria and 
I both wanted to help you.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:09.850
I've never met anyone else like you two.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:10.920
Huh?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:15.360
Okay! Let's hurry up and get home!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.450
Right!

00:11:17.110 --> 00:11:19.060
Oh, right. Here.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:22.820
That's a Guide Stone.

00:11:22.820 --> 00:11:25.550
It's an item you use when you 
get separated from your party.

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:27.370
When you get separated?

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:31.340
As long as you hold on to it, it'll lead 
you to a party member's location.

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:35.380
It also glows red when their life is danger.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:37.460
Wow, that's handy!

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:39.350
Try not to get separated 
in the first place, though.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:40.470
Okay!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.380
Are we really going to be all right?

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:46.390
Did that just click?

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:49.880
Sorry.

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:51.890
I stepped on something.

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.400
Seiichi! Saria!

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:01.650
Artoria-san!

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:06.950
Damn it.

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:10.710
Can you hear me? Seiichi! Saria!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:11.440
Tsk.

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:13.960
<i>I need to rejoin them quickly.</i>

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:19.790
We got separated right away.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.300
Wh-Wh-What do we do now?!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.930
We were just talking about how we 
shouldn't get separated and then this!

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:28.470
This wall! This wall!

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:30.470
Ow!

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:33.480
Hey, Seiichi! We have this!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.470
The Guide Stone!

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:37.640
Oh, right! Good thinking, Saria!

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.980
But how do we use it?

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:40.480
Huh?

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:42.990
Uh... I don't know.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.630
Um, um... Which way...

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:47.490
...do we go?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.690
Yes!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.330
Go!

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:02.010
Yes, we know she's on the other side!

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.980
Stopping here won't get us anywhere!

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:08.140
Seiichi, there's a path over there!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.510
All right, let's go!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.900
<i>Damn it... Not here!</i>

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:24.750
Don't get in my way!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.810
Power Slash!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.730
Please be safe,

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:42.040
you two.

00:13:45.560 --> 00:13:46.790
A dead end.

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:48.050
Another dead end.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.050
Here, too.

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.180
And here!

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:54.560
Where are we supposed to go?!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.190
Hey, Seiichi.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:08.700
You're ignoring it?

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:11.570
Well, it's obviously suspicious.

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:12.990
I know, but...

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.900
Open me.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.320
I said I'm not opening it.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.460
Huh?

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:20.920
Open me!

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:22.450
Really?

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.260
Open me!

00:14:32.760 --> 00:14:35.270
Hey, timeout, timeout!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.290
<i>Damn it! In that case...</i>

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:38.770
Aqua Bind!

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:42.770
Y-You'll pay!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.460
H-Huh?

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:48.530
It disappeared.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.650
I just used a binding spell.

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.790
<i>You leveled up.</i>

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.480
This is just like that time with Xeanos.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:09.830
<i>Long ago, the treasure chest was a 
necessary item in any dungeon delve,</i>

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:15.310
<i>but after the invention of Item Box, 
it lost all reason to exist.</i>

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:18.680
I want humans to interact with me again!

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:25.750
<i>That single desire led it to grow limbs and 
gain the ability to speak and use magic.</i>

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.450
Water Magic!

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:29.190
Fire Magic!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:35.830
<i>However, humans began calling the treasure 
chest a monster and persecuting it.</i>

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.230
<i>With its hope lost,</i>

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:43.650
<i>the treasure chest continued to roam 
around places it held fond memories of.</i>

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.230
Poor treasure chest.

00:15:49.230 --> 00:15:51.730
I kind of feel bad for it.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.160
Ring of Misfortune?

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:57.220
It's Legendary Equipment.

00:15:57.610 --> 00:16:00.890
It multiplies the wearer's Luck by -2?

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:04.730
What the heck? Nothing good 
comes from equipping this.

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:05.830
Huh?

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:10.000
Hey, Seiichi?

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:13.240
Whoa! That's so shameless!

00:16:14.710 --> 00:16:16.950
Was it always this color?

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.380
<i>This is...</i>

00:16:38.230 --> 00:16:39.320
<i>What now?</i>

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:42.140
<i>This route is the only path.</i>

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.400
Who's there?!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:17:00.890
Human, have you come here to be eaten?!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:21.430
B-Bel-san!

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:26.450
Now, if you've learned your lesson, 
never try to act on your own again.

00:17:27.620 --> 00:17:30.440
I'm so sorry.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:31.890
I'll have you know,

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:34.940
Black Dragon God is way worse than this.

00:17:36.870 --> 00:17:40.850
He's renowned as the strongest 
one in the Demon Lord's army.

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:46.460
Anyone who runs into him 
has the worst luck of all.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:49.960
Does this mean...

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.960
It also glows red when their life is danger.

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:59.390
Sh-She's in danger!

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.970
S-Seiichi! Th-Th-The Guide Stone!

00:18:02.820 --> 00:18:04.970
All right!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.810
Go!

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:12.070
Déjà vu.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:13.750
Damn it!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.990
This wall! This stupid wall!

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.740
That really hurts!

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.240
Wh-What do we do?

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:24.260
Damn it!

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:31.750
Perhaps I should praise you for putting 
up quite the fight for a human.

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:39.260
I can't afford to die until I've rejoined 
them and seen them safely home!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:48.350
I'll show you

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:51.770
how I earned the name "Calamity"!

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.860
<i>Now this...</i>

00:18:57.860 --> 00:18:59.860
I don't need rationality!

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:04.010
I'll turn myself into a calamity!

00:19:04.380 --> 00:19:07.790
Calamity Berserk!

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:25.450
This is why you humans are such fools.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:31.810
Know your place.

00:19:55.630 --> 00:20:01.440
To think there was still someone among 
humans who could surprise me so.

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:10.390
<i>I'm sorry, you two.</i>

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:14.360
<i>I'd forgotten how to smile 
after constantly bringing</i>

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:16.170
<i>misfortune to others for so long...</i>

00:20:16.170 --> 00:20:17.580
Very well.

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:21.140
I'll finish this in one blow for you.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:26.160
<i>So I wanted to at least 
see you two home safely.</i>

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:29.910
<i>But I got you both caught 
up in my misfortune.</i>

00:20:31.260 --> 00:20:32.660
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.020
Artoria-san.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.830
Artoria-san!

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.930
You two?

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:51.280
We're here to save you, Artoria-san!

