He's a monster.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:38.730
Speaking of which, you're a dual wielder?

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:39.700
Yes.

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:43.990
One is black and the other's white.

00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:47.350
They let the wielder pass their 
mana and stamina to allies,

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:50.530
and they can heal some 
degree of damage overnight.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:52.920
That's totally cheating.

00:22:52.920 --> 00:22:58.230
Hey, Artoria-san, what's the 
battleaxe you wield called?

00:22:58.560 --> 00:23:00.920
It's called "Grand Axe."

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:04.890
It's an exceptional item that doubles 
my physical abilities during battle.

00:23:04.890 --> 00:23:06.970
Power Slash!

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.580
So cool!

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:10.330
What kind of skill is that?

00:23:10.330 --> 00:23:12.660
A skill that doubles my Attack!

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.390
So when it's combined with Grand Axe...

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:19.320
Two times two is... how many times?

00:23:19.320 --> 00:23:20.620
Four times.

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:23.660
Wow! That's cheating!

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:25.670
Does that apply to these breasts, too?

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:28.760
Abeshi!

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:34.020
How are my breasts cheating?!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:38.360
Seiichi fights to save Artoria-san!

00:23:38.360 --> 00:23:39.640
So cool!

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:42.270
Wait, huh? What are those two doing?

